      "content": "the waves are just getting louder... and i can see the lights from the shore but they might as well be on the moon. it feels like everything is already gone. like there's no point even trying to scramble for a lifeboat when the ocean is just gonna take us anyway. honestly, i'm just so tired of the noise.",
